  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Eins von 50 nummerierten Exemplaren, eigenhändig vom Künstler in Graphit betitelt, signiert und nummeriert. Enthält zwei montierte Farbfotografien, 473 schwarz-weiße Fotokopien sowie eine gefaltete Standort-Heliographie. Originalleinenband</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"The book shows the complete series of collages of 473 plants, collected in the meadow near Eschenau; the book is divided in 16 parts; on the front of the pages the 473 plants and grasses are reproduced in Xerox-copy on paper (29.7 x 21 cm); a number followed by two letters indicates the location of the specimens in each of the 16 squares; the book contains a folded map (heliography, opened 59.8 x 47.5 cm) showing a square of 40 x 40 cm divided in 16 squares horizontally numbered A, B, C, D and vertically W, X, Y, Z and inside each square the location of all plants are marked and numbered 1 etc.; the handwritten titlepage is followed by a handwritten colophon and by 2 pages with photographs (8.8 x 13 cm) of 16 dm² in the meadow with and without the plants; bound in canvas"-- https://www.hermandevries.org/ (Stand: 27.04.2026)</subfield>
  </datafield>
